#: scenario7:scenario7_F1D91C51_4F99_4780_829C_DFD37ACB336A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3fe9818bac377637b4df35659829d12ab7a201195208afaf93d8fadf5e45abfa
#. default-sha256: 5a8163bcca695bbf65fcc86c2a83dd2f687799114e63952b7034c97964044ce4
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F1D91C51_4F99_4780_829C_DFD37ACB336A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫The next day, I awoke with a "
"terrible fever."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫第二天——⟪k:12⟫我发了严重的高烧。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_5A90CE79_FF7B_4187_BAE0_20AF39FCD941
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e31f8af1ec7cc581756238ea513283d777c7b73e8e1cc0813f38218a1675b2a9
#. default-sha256: d5161990e0b58c20d6a4011f4ceb26490059c5d9cd5daa821e713dc791648130
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5A90CE79_FF7B_4187_BAE0_20AF39FCD941"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I hovered in a sweltering wave of heat, unable to tell dream and reality apart, listening to "
"a seemingly endless stream of cracking noises."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫在不知是梦还是现实的灼热隙间里——⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫听到不绝于耳的龟裂之声。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_2358D0B0_F81B_49DC_98A5_0E40E057D26E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 277e73487d7a2f51b8705fabfc9e4563b85a3cf915fda0f00ecd62ac4dbead8f
#. default-sha256: 143beb804f616a189405a9ad4c5f410bc674c4175d50fe6043c883f3a5a6be05
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2358D0B0_F81B_49DC_98A5_0E40E057D26E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The sounds were coming from inside my body.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I thought I was falling apart."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫这声音似乎是从我的身体内部传出来的——⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫我以为，⟪k:3⟫自己肯定是坏掉了。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_9A6ABD87_065F_45B1_98C4_5C7CEDE5CDE5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd149bbbd9cc9976ca5bfe2b5a0d15e56dc2633b17277ddc86fa4ad16f41e37c
#. default-sha256: 9723eb7818c5b6b8962e373322803a04400e007128f97bb9d690d3ad4aef62bb
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9A6ABD87_065F_45B1_98C4_5C7CEDE5CDE5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Mother was horribly worried."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫母亲非常担心。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_BE7745A7_EBC2_4845_902B_6BB1BD2FE613
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd2adacbdf6e7b43cfa9043bfab98a3be2fa451cc4b3f736219d51ee67215584
#. default-sha256: b5c2b262ea5010c401b19af816bfb410462077db39aa19daac5ffb48482e54ca
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BE7745A7_EBC2_4845_902B_6BB1BD2FE613"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had never been the most healthy child, but I had never fallen this ill either."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫虽然我原本就体弱，⟪k:1⟫但至今都没有大病。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_9A50E480_AE92_4FBF_90B9_11ED809885BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f71b714714222d96c5f9ee3a534d9ad4b952cfa05b1edb3a6a0991b4ff27dc3b
#. default-sha256: f2708f2618087ef431a8ca27b545e10dce0c6ed98e8b86eb1e72905893e8ac65
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9A50E480_AE92_4FBF_90B9_11ED809885BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I couldn’t get out of bed.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫My voice was raspy, like an old woman’s.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I was "
"genuinely afraid I would wither away and die."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫我无法起身，⟪k:1⟫声音也像老人一样嘶哑——⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫就连我自己，⟪k:4⟫都认为我会这样腐朽下去，然"
"后死去。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_9DFE4400_A100_4512_A293_640E884E0448
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: df4c7cb567fe20222ad0b516ea5caa2001ad873da70d64016e432289ad23d952
#. default-sha256: 1448961622ddf42b7f720238df71efe5682579f1a528ad6cd11f64feaed0227c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9DFE4400_A100_4512_A293_640E884E0448"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Mother called in doctor after doctor to see me, but they all said it was the flu."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫之后，⟪k:1⟫医生换了一个又一个，⟪k:2⟫他们都断定我是感冒。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_9B0872F9_8B72_4CCD_BCA1_00968A4D19CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a2e18947e59db202c31bfa49a2bb08cfaed962d33a1a8f694d732915f0367244
#. default-sha256: e43283125e877dba227490a22d4ece1f6646b1c360d0c5a66feeddc5deeeb2ed
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9B0872F9_8B72_4CCD_BCA1_00968A4D19CC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That bodily pain was common with a fever."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫说发高烧时身体痛很常见。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_B0834569_89A7_4A75_8EEB_ADC8174E35E9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 56aae09f9edd93618793a94d8e0ddd2dd6689c6af59a847da7985b12cabc542c
#. default-sha256: 7367eacacb669d917333981a7cdfef555a69571e3a9411e745ff576407337546
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B0834569_89A7_4A75_8EEB_ADC8174E35E9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫While there was a doctor in the house, Mother was able to remain relatively calm,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫有医生在母亲就能恢复冷静，⟪k:1⟫但是——"

#: scenario7:scenario7_5B8AFEEF_7744_4E0A_B95A_8D0ADFF881A3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7817b056efcc97b7bb4765e4934718cd448d216c67a8ccc9f4cb3dd373c07c98
#. default-sha256: 8026e883de72ec18aecb1c295c77034f4382deb8914762b9e75592230d58fa66
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5B8AFEEF_7744_4E0A_B95A_8D0ADFF881A3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but once they were gone, the anxiety came back. ⟪k:1⟫She stayed with me, day and night, even "
"foregoing sleep."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫一旦医生离开了，⟪k:1⟫她的情绪就会变得极其不稳定，⟪k:2⟫废寝忘食地守在我的身边。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_930E5261_C89B_49F8_B299_A99BF37D8E3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f26057383c1067b2478e50ff18670ffde2c0477691a617461824cba96300e4b8
#. default-sha256: 66f952772a60e39ff8cf73647633b4b5ff626a268d8f393c9531b9fe00d0a99a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_930E5261_C89B_49F8_B299_A99BF37D8E3D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Her hands gripped mine. They held me fast."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫母亲会握住我的手指，⟪k:1⟫抱住我的身体。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_CB48627A_80F4_499B_BD28_D389CCD92A26
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb0f960870ca26df85f6740f91f1904691e504b247f51d96b6711e858e7fb8ce
#. default-sha256: 432bc9bb8c65988f56116ccbf64df1754866e2b982070d7e08e126ed1e4cef49
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CB48627A_80F4_499B_BD28_D389CCD92A26"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She had her head bowed, as if in prayer."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫她低着头，⟪k:1⟫仿佛在向神或天使祈祷。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_884467C2_57AC_43E9_BAD3_47857FA710BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e34727dfda8788fb79248d98c160f27ad623500c22115c85cb49f52079e3f97b
#. default-sha256: a8b05d5d58105b08e93f566f5efbeb937f629c76fc9a78d366a7fb89569c701e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_884467C2_57AC_43E9_BAD3_47857FA710BE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Don’t worry... ⟪k:1⟫It’ll be all right, Michelle.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫God is watching over you... ⟪k:4⟫"
"He will protect you..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫米歇尔……⟪k:1⟫米歇尔……⟪k:2⟫没事的。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫神……肯定会庇佑你的……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_DBA90755_DFD7_4EC8_A226_250D17981B38
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4cc37d1113981f574ce29f7cbb9bb01749ab179a95437f0cbce6c00d1a7fa74f
#. default-sha256: dc35c9c7ab0d48e33b4890f3a74118367e9091bfcfa4a487e3354b776b9872e2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DBA90755_DFD7_4EC8_A226_250D17981B38"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You are His child...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You are His angel sent to Earth..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫因为你是神之子……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫是天使的转世啊……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_F151E5BB_71B9_4D70_B606_94E38C173BAA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ddc2123e1bf907baa7a67b3e4650236db3d62e71492c34ac72a8613701a311c0
#. default-sha256: 6945a52379212d73c2e6135cdae2e91a14aed8b64c46ed4e26b5cffd68eddc8c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F151E5BB_71B9_4D70_B606_94E38C173BAA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He will not forsake you...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The doctors say it’s just the flu..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫祂绝不会抛弃你……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫医生也说，⟪k:3⟫你只是感冒了而已……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_8F36946A_C49E_475F_9514_0BD7E7BC2449
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08ac09c94e6f3512e492890d8f51b12f8ccad01673c3dd309640329cd273691a
#. default-sha256: 3ed85afacec4566dca559bff95803678266d8934f1e174a8579964a9c53f68b3
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8F36946A_C49E_475F_9514_0BD7E7BC2449"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though her words seemed to be directed at me, there was a vacantness in her voice, as if "
"they were really for herself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫母亲看似在对我说，⟪k:1⟫实则神情恍惚。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫她不断向自己重复着这些空洞的话语，⟪k:4⟫是为了"
"说服自己。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_3E6EACDC_4063_44A7_A907_1D8A41C134C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5faecc4b8814aa74f9bd668c76ced11a5e6dec6b68b64fea16e36f3bbaeb57d7
#. default-sha256: def2b1a6e114e8a13a561f3633328efb50d10a19b9e0fff41f6dca7bf91e64ed
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3E6EACDC_4063_44A7_A907_1D8A41C134C3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫For so long, she had wanted a daughter."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫她真的想要个女儿。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_AE779766_B600_44A3_826C_F89A5EA9FB46
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7551841e006bd04b619c47d42216ee4ce11d92a980e7252a6309f707da91cbd0
#. default-sha256: d27d4bcf23367e983066cf9a95b3fea7ea64e2e6ddf77955c0fd11f3ca74fe8e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_AE779766_B600_44A3_826C_F89A5EA9FB46"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I couldn’t understand her fixation,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫虽然不懂她为什么如此执着——"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D55C7EBE_B4DE_40DE_A881_F0DC1A124062
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 16c9360e9627619a0a3fb57275d7d53835adf7869f9fd4508070afade8d675ef
#. default-sha256: 82c8d7ed0d4cb00960097dbda8016abb83fd0d17ae8c32771f15b43eb03ed534
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D55C7EBE_B4DE_40DE_A881_F0DC1A124062"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but seeing her there through my cloudy eyes, I wanted to apologize for ever thinking "
"spending time with her was agonizing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫但我在朦胧的视线中看到她那副模样，⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫想到之前自己觉得和她在一起会感到痛苦，⟪k:3⟫我就想"
"对她道歉。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_E8A1882A_69ED_4483_985D_36EC44A05515
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a58a2f84ff217fc3db88ff65a5efe2ac63b62fe3195c1df7154cddcd78d5a61f
#. default-sha256: 2e30c08baf6b11c2b8037f5db5b26f28c2e21652864c17bdd2e02d317dba9aa6
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E8A1882A_69ED_4483_985D_36EC44A05515"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How are you feeling?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Your mother’s here for you. Don’t worry."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫你感觉难受吗……？⟪k:1⟫母亲在这里哦，⟪k:2⟫放心吧……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_4BFC0A0A_CF7B_43E8_AFE0_C0BD252C0900
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5d40ebf929f0796327c8ebe09e36beb5bb5ee50d908f98d3f7b58b51ef587cc7
#. default-sha256: 8645a3c3c228b384ff84c3f7329d492c20f0109cb9567eb156f88edcdcd41ac5
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4BFC0A0A_CF7B_43E8_AFE0_C0BD252C0900"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But the only sound that came from my mouth was a faint gasp."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但是，⟪k:1⟫我的声音根本不成样子。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_ABF6BBD6_A164_4D4A_9737_D1FF16AD80E6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 283a4bd69ff719c94ea28c6ec3a43cdf3260c68bb1ca021e23e8407f2921ae6f
#. default-sha256: c74e8d3aa6a2619ca4705f47ecae70fed9de4e6dabc8419c1dd1905900a7496e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_ABF6BBD6_A164_4D4A_9737_D1FF16AD80E6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I drifted in and out of sleep, Mother’s hand wrapped around my own."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我感受着母亲的指尖，⟪k:1⟫落入不知第几次的沉眠。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_BE583775_9281_49FD_AD87_8E850FF4C7F2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e8c8cf64679ea190dbb0b322e79d4eaf28b97e5a26f00f5a5e0af2043cde9a4e
#. default-sha256: f8d0f45f7abd509c50aed16d04b07d374cde0d94932a65a1ed13a97b03181e0c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BE583775_9281_49FD_AD87_8E850FF4C7F2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And I had numerous dreams."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫接着做了不知第几次的梦。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_A98538DF_E530_42E4_857B_6E0DB5206773
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1148cd48e49880df1965600117f3c80e869d36abe02c397b6af7cd9c14815bfd
#. default-sha256: c4d57d0246179929c91de88c120a1eb8c029efca4248947f8d2ac1d42e5c3208
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A98538DF_E530_42E4_857B_6E0DB5206773"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫In my dreams, I was a man."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫在梦里，⟪k:3⟫我是男人。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_17B971C9_54DD_4ECA_879A_10A0738677A7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee39d6665c9b90fa2f2ce5ae18baca84fc5f9c2cc8e161fe944adc802b070992
#. default-sha256: 56e77632678fcff63aa78b2eb4b1ce9e54daed046c8f9fe028c3334ab9579fc6
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_17B971C9_54DD_4ECA_879A_10A0738677A7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫In my dreams, I was Didier and I was Georges."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫在梦里，⟪k:3⟫我既是迪迪尔，⟪k:4⟫又是乔治斯。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_56939500_E8C9_47AA_ADD1_22312681BFA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a5d29742498a5357bcf1ff1c14f18e9c992d2cc1ba1d2828a309df77199ad6e
#. default-sha256: 19a5d846ab74b2cff998a383c3c2d88676e80c12d638a1eda95132e81a9b62af
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_56939500_E8C9_47AA_ADD1_22312681BFA3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫In my dreams, I fell in love with Aimee,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫在梦里，⟪k:3⟫我再次爱上了艾梅——"

#: scenario7:scenario7_3D45B051_380A_4FD6_96A7_200F6F0BFD4C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dbd0cde36ab29c42c3df4fb3e957ebdb484dbad630caaee246370ba49beb69e6
#. default-sha256: 0cf2593358e97cbdb1c1ff4839acbeebeea2ea016867158af72a9a3f62efa152
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3D45B051_380A_4FD6_96A7_200F6F0BFD4C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and in my dreams, I loved her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫在梦里，⟪k:3⟫我和艾梅心意相通。"

